        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charlotte Baldwin Allen, Augustus Chapman Allen\n- Places: Houston, Texas, North America\n- Topics: Founding of Houston, History of Texas, Spanish exploration, Native American tribes\n\nFacts:\n- In 1519, the recorded history of Texas began with the arrival of the first Spanish conquistadors in the region of North America now known as Texas.\n- In 1519, the first Spanish conquistadors found the region now known as Texas populated by numerous Native American tribes.\n- Charlotte Baldwin Allen was the wife of Augustus Chapman Allen.\n- Augustus Chapman Allen used Charlotte Baldwin Allen's inheritance to help finance the founding of Houston.",
